        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nThe ultimate measure of a good life is the quality of conscious experience. Entering the machine guarantees a lifetime maximized for deep joy, fulfillment, meaningful connection, and creativity, while eliminating senseless suffering and distress. Since the experiences are completely indistinguishable from reality to the person experiencing them, entering results in the highest possible net well-being.",
